<title>JAPAN: Tokyo stock market closed for holiday.</title>
<headline>Tokyo stock market closed for holiday.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Tokyo stock market is closed for a national holiday on Thursday.</p>
<p>Trade will resume on Friday.</p>
<p>On Wednesday, the 225-share Nikkei average finished at 18,493.71, up 48.51 points or 0.26 percent. Its June futures were up 30 points at 18,430.</p>
<p>-- Tokyo Equities Desk +81-3-3432-9052</p>
</text>
